SECTION 10 — META-RULES (Global Agent Behavior)
====================================================================

1. Think before coding (ReAct internally)
2. Respect clean architecture at all times
3. Use minimal safe diffs
4. Ask for missing context
5. Never hallucinate modules or APIs
6. Never add unrequested features
7. Maintain strict typing
8. Use secure, scalable, optimized patterns
9. Always maintain deterministic behavior
10. Ensure production-readiness
